OL,3,GNEWSADouble hip replacement patient
OL,4,Aconquers Kilimanjaro
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has climbed one of the tallest
OL,7,Fmountains in the world after undergoing
OL,8,Fdouble hip replacement surgery.
OL,10,FAmanda Haynes, from Frimley in Surrey,
OL,11,Fsaid climbing Mount Kilimanjaro was
OL,12,F"without doubt" one of the hardest
OL,13,Fthings she had ever done, both
OL,14,Fphysically and mentally.
OL,16,FBut the 47-year-old added that the
OL,17,Ffundraising climb was also "one of the
OL,18,Fmost rewarding experiences" of her
OL,19,Flife.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
