OL,3,GNEWSADouble hip replacement patient
OL,4,Aconquers Kilimanjaro
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I hope my story inspires anyone who
OL,7,Fhas faced major surgery, physical
OL,8,Fchallenges or self-doubt to believe
OL,9,Fthat their own adventures and
OL,10,Fachievements are still possible," she
OL,11,Fsaid.
